IGEL_AMDGPU_FIX_EDP_NOT_WAKING_UP_AFTER_SUSPEND
	  Since kernel 6.10.x there is a issue that the internal display does
	  not work after resume from suspend. As it is not sure if this is
	  a general issue or a device issue we add a kernel parameter to
	  solve this.

	  Source: IGEL
